\item{Aggregation}{\code{\link[=rt_summary]{rt_summary()}} turns surviving trials into the mean,
variance and accuracy the EZ-diffusion equations take, by sample moments,
robust moments, trimming, or a fitted mixture. \code{\link[=ez_ddm]{ez_ddm()}} inverts them
into parameters; \code{\link[=adjust_accuracy]{adjust_accuracy()}} corrects the counts.}
\item{Comparison}{\code{\link[=screen_compare]{screen_compare()}} applies several rules at once and
